@*
    THE LIST SHELL — the table card as a used component, not a copied one (BL-440 package 1, 2026-09-23).

    ⚠ WHAT THIS RENDERS IS EXACTLY WHAT THE GOLDEN REFERENCES DREW BY HAND, in this order: the card, the shared
    shaped placeholder, the responsive wrapper, the v2 table with its data mode, the empty control column, the
    optional selection column, the page's columns, the optional actions column. The render-equality test in
    Diten.Web.Tests (ListShellRenderEqualityTests) holds the pre-component HTML of both golden lists and asserts
    this shell still produces it byte-for-byte after whitespace normalisation. Change the markup here and that
    test is the one that goes red — as it should, because 138 lists will eventually stand on this.

    ⚠ THIS FILE PRODUCES NO TEXT. Every header is handed in already localized (Localizer[...].Value on the page),
    so the shell has no resx of its own and no language can be missing from it.

    ⚠ DATA MODE IS FAIL-CLOSED. "server" or "client", or the render throws. A misspelt mode is not a warning
    on a page that will silently page wrong.
*@
@model Diten.Web.Models.DataTable.DataTableListShellViewModel
@{
    if (!Model.IsDataModeValid)
    {
        throw new InvalidOperationException(
            $"_ListShell: DataMode must be one of {string.Join(" | ", Diten.Web.Models.DataTable.DataTableListShellViewModel.AllowedDataModes)}, got '{Model.DataMode}' (table '{Model.TableId}').");
    }
    var tableClass = string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(Model.Slug) ? "table border-top" : $"datatables-{Model.Slug} table border-top";
}

<div class="card">
    <partial name="_TableSkeleton" />

    <div class="card-datatable table-responsive">
        <table id="@Model.TableId" data-dt-standard="v2" data-dt-data-mode="@Model.DataMode" class="@tableClass">
            <thead>
                <tr>
                    <th></th>
                    @if (Model.HasSelection)
                    {
                        <th class="cell-fit"><input type="checkbox" class="dt-checkboxes-select-all form-check-input"></th>
                    }
                    @foreach (var column in Model.Columns)
                    {
                        if (string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(column.CssClass))
                        {
                            <th>@column.Header</th>
                        }
                        else
                        {
                            <th class="@column.CssClass">@column.Header</th>
                        }
                    }
                    @if (Model.HasActions)
                    {
                        <th class="cell-fit text-end pe-3 all">@Model.ActionsHeader</th>
                    }
                </tr>
            </thead>
        </table>
    </div>
</div>
